diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9806b52..be24f0d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@ ### Added
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
+- Entities and memberships: `entities` (slug-routed, soft deletes) and `entity_memberships` with roles `owner`, `admin` and `employee`. A stored generated `owner_seq` column and the unique index `entity_memberships_one_owner` make the database reject a second owner per entity. Policies `EntityPolicy` and `EntityMembershipPolicy`, `UserRole` enum, and the `User`/`Entity`/`EntityMembership` relations and factories.
+- Entity pages: `POST /e/{entity}/pick` stores the current entity in the session (audit-logged), and the Livewire pages `/e/{entity}` (dashboard), `/e/{entity}/membros` (add members, change roles, remove members) and `/e/{entity}/settings` (owner only: rename, change slug, transfer ownership, delete entity). Domain writes live in `app/Actions/` (`AddEntityMember`, `AssignEntityMemberRole`, `RemoveEntityMember`, `UpdateEntity`, `DeleteEntity`, `TransferEntityOwnership`).
 - Auth system: Livewire `login`/`register`, password reset and email verification flows and the mail theme — with rate limiting, strict email validation and password rules ([#18](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/18), [#19](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/19)).
 - Portuguese (`pt_BR`) interface localization ([#7](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/7)).
 - Ops logging: `archive` (daily) and `audit` log channels, plus `App\Ops\DiscordOpsAlert` for human-pageable ops alerts ([#17](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/17)).
